    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "What's happening?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A competition.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Who's winning?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Everyone.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Everyone?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "According to their own benchmarks.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "That's not possible.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Quite possible. One measures mathematics. Another measures code. Another measures whether the machine knows which strawberry is larger.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Is it?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Apparently.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "And who measures the people measuring the strawberries?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Nobody. That would require another benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "We need one.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "A strawberry?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A benchmark!",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "For what?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Us.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Oh, dear.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      }
